cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the ISEP DEE MEEC Thesis Template in work where software/template citation is appropriate, please cite this repository."
title: "ISEP DEE MEEC Thesis Template"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "M. R. Cunha"
    given-names: "Vítor"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "21/09/2026"
license: "LPPL-1.3c"
repository-code: "https://github.com/VitorMRCunha/ISEP_DEE_MEEC_Thesis_Template"
url: "https://github.com/VitorMRCunha/ISEP_DEE_MEEC_Thesis_Template"
abstract: >-
  A maintained LaTeX dissertation template for the Master's Programme
  in Electrical and Computer Engineering (MEEC) at the Instituto
  Superior de Engenharia do Porto (ISEP). The project originated in
  2021 as an adaptation of the LaTeXTemplates Masters/Doctoral Thesis
  template and has since undergone extensive independent development.
keywords:
  - LaTeX
  - thesis
  - dissertation
  - MEEC
  - ISEP
